      ["LeanFM/Session/ChainTests.lean: Ride generates 200 sessions with seed 1, every one ended and accepted back by session_mdp events; the realized total equals the sum of each session's drawn amounts and is within 10 percent of 200 times the expected balance; the same seed gives the same stream; an amount that does not match its edge is refused by the walk; a session longer than 512 events is cut and marked not ended"]
