      ["clause:selfhost.session.proto", "clause:selfhost.session.lean", "clause:selfhost.session.openapi"]
      ["LeanFM/Session/Proto.lean", "LeanFM/Session/LeanGen.lean", "LeanFM/Session/Types.lean", "LeanFM/Session/Text.lean", "LeanFM/SessionTools.lean", "LeanFM/MCP.lean", "LeanFM/Generated/PlaceOrder.lean"]
      "Proto.lex turns the text into words, numbers, strings, symbols and // doc tokens with line numbers (/* */ skipped); Proto.ofProto walks them: syntax must be proto3, package, option and reserved are set aside, import, enum, service, nested message, oneof and map are refused, a field is [repeated|optional] type name = number [options]; with scalar mapping types to Nat, Int, String and Bool and other names to structures, Proto.jsonName naming each field (lowerCamelCase, _secr names kept) and Field.protoName keeping the original for Types.protoField, float, double and bytes refused, numbers checked against 1..536870911 minus 19000..19999 and for repeats, and Types.check over the result. Types.Field gains number, which Types.protoField writes when set. SessionTools.protoTypes reads the proto argument; parseProtocol and every reparse pass it to Text.parse, which refuses text structures beside it; compat passes proto (or oldProto) for the old version. Global.leanModule writes the structures, Role, Payload (constructors from labels, then act labels, by LeanGen.lower, keywords quoted), Event, and per role Typestate's machine as State, start, step (LeanGen.closure gathers each state's edges, following offer nothing and other, and cont, and marks finality; fork and serve are refused), final, involves and accepts; it refuses nondeterministic edges and colliding names. session_types answers leanModule, or leanModuleNote with the reason. LeanFM/Generated/PlaceOrder.lean is that module for examples/sessions/PlaceOrder.leanfm, compiled with the library."
